ArchWeb OS for macOS Installer
==================================
Version: 20.1.2
Architecture: universal (Intel & Apple Silicon M1/M2/M3 compatible)
Format: Apple Disk Image (.dmg) simulated engine wrapper

HOW TO INSTALL ON macOS:
1. Double-click the downloaded "archweb.dmg" or unzip your downloaded project.
2. Drag "ArchWeb OS" to your /Applications folder.
3. Open Terminal and run:
   chmod +x ./baslat.sh
   ./baslat.sh
4. If macOS Gatekeeper blocks execution (Unidentified Developer), go to:
   System Settings -> Privacy & Security -> Click "Open Anyway"
